  <config><![CDATA[{
  "game_id": 74,
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T17:08:25.000Z",
  "level_num": "custom",
  "user_id": 18603,
  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Auditing for Clarity & Accessibility\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Identify barriers in the app using the \"Three-Lens Audit,\" then use PAIR to fix the summary.\r\n\r\n1. **Three-Lens Audit**. Before coding, use the *Audit Tools* bar at the top of the preview window. Check for Clarity, Readability, and Accessibility and identify specific features that should be revised.\r\n \r\n2. Use PAIR to Fix All Three\r\n\t* **P - Prompt:** Ask the AI to make specific updates.\r\n\t* **A - Analyze:** Check the AI's result.\r\n\t    * **Clarity:** Did it remove difficult to understand words?\r\n\t    * **Readability:** Is it short? Does the text fit the box?\r\n\t    * **Accessibility:** Does high contrast work as intended?\r\n\t* **I - Integrate:** Working with AI Tutor, update the code to reflect your findings.\r\n\t* **R - Reflect:** Answer the reflection questions in your activity guide.\r\n",
    "submittable": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
    "initial_view_mode": "split",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "ai_tutor_mode": "engineer",
    "predict_settings": {
